Spec: Recreated Restaurant Menu

Purpose:
  Provide legible digital menu pages faithful to the restaurant's photographed menu.

Owns:
  ./*.png: Recreated menu page images
  ./transcription.json: Source transcription and exact image generation prompts

Can read:
  /assets/menu-originals: Restaurant-provided menu photographs

Must:
  Every source dish, ingredient description and price is retained on its corresponding page.
  Pages preserve the cream and olive palette, prominent headings and food imagery of the physical menu.
  Pages are flat, evenly lit and contain no photographed fingers, table background or cast shadows.
  Generated text is visually compared against the transcription before integration.
  Source photographs remain the authority for menu content; unclear information is flagged rather than invented.
  Recreated food imagery is illustrative and retains the rights attribution of the source menu.

Done when:
  All five menu pages are available locally and referenced by the website.
  Production build succeeds.
